<title>USA: Southern Energy Homes names Batchelor chair.</title>
<headline>Southern Energy Homes names Batchelor chair.</headline>
<dateline>ADDISON, Ala 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Energy Homes Inc said Tuesday its board had chosen Wendell Batchelor as its chairman.</p>
<p>The company, which produces manufactured homes, also said the board had elected Keith Holdbrooks as executive vice president and chief operating officer, effective August 27.  </p>
<p>The company said Batchelor would replace Jonathan Lee, who will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Holdbrooks, meanwhile, is filling a new position, a company spokeswoman later said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
